{"rows":[{"cols":[{"designInfo":{"stencilSuperIds":["Output"],"stencilId":"cloud-output"},"label":"Sync Data X-Ray Classifications","value":"<p>This workflow pulls the current classification catalog from Data X-Ray and mirrors it into the Classifications domain in Collibra.</p><p><b>For each classification, annotator, extractor and label in Data X-Ray:</b></p><ul><li>create the matching asset if it doesn't exist yet, or update its description, link, search link and subtype attributes if it does</li><li>tag it with <code>dataxray-classification-sync</code> so future runs know it's managed by this workflow</li></ul><p><b>Assets in the Classifications domain that carry the sync tag but are no longer in Data X-Ray will be retired (status Obsolete)</b> — never deleted, so saved searches and imported files keep their links; a classification that reappears in Data X-Ray is reactivated. Untagged assets are never touched.</p><p>Click <b>Send</b> below to start the sync. A task called <b>Sync Results</b> will then appear in your Collibra task inbox showing how many assets were created, updated and retired.</p>","defaultValue":false,"size":12,"ignore":false,"visible":true,"enabled":true,"isRequired":false,"id":"startSyncInfo","type":"htmlComponent"}]}],"metadata":{"key":"startSyncForm","name":"Start Sync","description":"Confirmation screen shown before the Data X-Ray classifications sync runs.","version":"1","modelType":"form","flowableDesignVersion":3110,"palette":"flowable-core-form-palette"}}
